    "Corrected: Now and therefore were exchanged. Rule 14 rules on this exact pair — וְעַתָּה rendered Now therefore gives Now to עַתָּה, which writes its own lexeme, and therefore to the waw, though the waw's word stands second. The accepted alignment had read the pair by position instead, which rule 14 expressly forbids.",
